+/**
+  **************************************************************************
+  * @file     at32f403a_407_clock.c
+  * @brief    system clock config program
+  **************************************************************************
+  *                       Copyright notice & Disclaimer
+  *
+  * The software Board Support Package (BSP) that is made available to
